== comparison
total sampled bytes (all TU_IMG_INV lines):
  results/raw/game-patched-imginv4.log: 3644 images, 7764 MiB
  results/raw/game-patched-imginv5.log: 4183 images, 8110 MiB
deposed linear: 3801 MiB -> 1631 MiB (-2170 MiB, -57.1%); model predicted -2201 MiB (-57.9%)
HUD window 40-50 s: clocks 220/680, gpu_load avg 88%, fps p25 15.4 (inventory run, fps not the point)

== how to reproduce
  1. apply experiments/exp-14-image-inventory.patch to the tree (both the
     baseline and the candidate build; on the baseline revert patch 0014
     first: git apply -R patches/0014-turnip-mutable-no-list-tiling.patch)
  2. rebuild, run: TU_IMG_INV=1 ./scripts/run-game.sh
  3. walk the protocol above; the log lands in results/game-patched.log
  4. python3 scripts/fmt-list-gate-check.py --no-list <log> | grep -B1 deposed
     -> 'total deposed' is the number compared above
